====================================================================

Any breach of this license automatically and immediately terminates the
rights granted in Sections 2.1, 2.2, 3(b), 5.1, and 5.3(b). Upon termination
You must stop using and delete all copies of the Mod in Your possession, and
cease any distribution then in progress.

Sections 1, 3, 4, 5.2, 5.3(a), and 7 through 15, together with the reservation
of rights stated above, survive termination. A Contributor's credit under
Section 5.3(a) is an acknowledgment of authorship and is not withdrawn by
termination.

Termination under this Section is without prejudice to any other remedy
available to the Author.

